---
// Testimonials3: masonry "wall of love" with six quotes of varied length.
---

<section class="bg-bg py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
      <p class="inline-flex rounded-button bg-brand-50 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-700 dark:bg-brand-950/40 dark:text-brand-300">Wall of love</p>
      <h2 class="mt-5 font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg sm:text-4xl">Kind words from calmer teams</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">Unedited notes from people who plan their week in Halcyon.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 columns-1 gap-6 sm:columns-2 lg:columns-3">
      <figure class="mb-6 break-inside-avoid rounded-card border border-line bg-bg p-6 shadow-sm">
        <blockquote>
          <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-fg">I open Halcyon once in the morning, know exactly what my day is, and close it. That is the highest praise I can give a work tool.</p>
        </blockquote>
        <figcaption class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-3">
          <img src="/media/avatar-5.svg" alt="Portrait of Daniel Kim" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full object-cover" />
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-fg">Daniel Kim</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted">Product Designer, Juniper</p>
          </div>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <figure class="mb-6 break-inside-avoid rounded-card border border-line bg-bg p-6 shadow-sm">
        <blockquote>
          <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-fg">Set up in an afternoon. No consultant required.</p>
        </blockquote>
        <figcaption class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-3">
          <img src="/media/avatar-6.svg" alt="Portrait of Leila Haddad" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full object-cover" />
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-fg">Leila Haddad</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted">Operations Manager, Solstice</p>
          </div>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <figure class="mb-6 break-inside-avoid rounded-card border border-brand-200 bg-brand-50 p-6 shadow-sm dark:border-brand-800/60 dark:bg-brand-950/40">
        <blockquote>
          <p class="font-display text-xl font-medium leading-snug tracking-tight text-fg">We tried four planning tools in two years. Halcyon is the only one the whole team still uses, and the only one nobody complains about in retro.</p>
        </blockquote>
        <figcaption class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-3">
          <img src="/media/avatar-7.svg" alt="Portrait of Marcus Bell" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full object-cover" />
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-fg">Marcus Bell</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted">CTO, Quanta</p>
          </div>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <figure class="mb-6 break-inside-avoid rounded-card border border-line bg-bg p-6 shadow-sm">
        <blockquote>
          <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-fg">The weekly digest replaced three recurring meetings. Our Fridays are now for finishing things, not for reporting on them. I did not expect software to change the mood of the office, but it has.</p>
        </blockquote>
        <figcaption class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-3">
          <img src="/media/avatar-8.svg" alt="Portrait of Sofia Marchetti" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full object-cover" />
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-fg">Sofia Marchetti</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted">Managing Partner, Meridian</p>
          </div>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <figure class="mb-6 break-inside-avoid rounded-card border border-line bg-bg p-6 shadow-sm">
        <blockquote>
          <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-fg">Quiet hours are genius. Nothing pings me after six, and everything is waiting in a tidy summary the next morning.</p>
        </blockquote>
        <figcaption class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-3">
          <img src="/media/avatar-2.svg" alt="Portrait of Tomás Herrera" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full object-cover" />
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-fg">Tomás Herrera</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted">Engineering Lead, Kestrel</p>
          </div>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <figure class="mb-6 break-inside-avoid rounded-card border border-line bg-bg p-6 shadow-sm">
        <blockquote>
          <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-fg">Our new hires understand the roadmap on day one. They read the timeline, see who owns what, and start contributing without a week of catch-up calls.</p>
        </blockquote>
        <figcaption class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-3">
          <img src="/media/avatar-1.svg" alt="Portrait of Priya Raman" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full object-cover" />
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-fg">Priya Raman</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted">Head of Product, Northwind</p>
          </div>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
